OL,3,GNEWSAPM pays tribute to boy who died
OL,4,Afrom cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has paid tribute to
OL,7,Fa 14-year-old boy who died nine months
OL,8,Fafter being diagnosed with brain
OL,9,Fcancer.
OL,11,FMax Hall from Corby was diagnosed with
OL,12,Fan "incurable" brain tumour last year
OL,13,Fand died in August.
OL,15,FLee Barron, Labour MP for Corby & East
OL,16,FNorthamptonshire, raised the subject of
OL,17,FMax's death in Parliament and called on
OL,18,Fministers to meet his family and other
OL,19,Forganisations.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
