OL,3,GNEWSAPM pays tribute to boy who died
OL,4,Afrom cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn his first House of Commons
OL,7,Fappearance as PM, Andy Burnham said
OL,8,Fministers would meet with Max's family
OL,9,Fand asked Barron to "pass on my
OL,10,Fsympathies to Max's family. It is
OL,11,Fdevastating news".
